                                    children: `One of the major issues that I have with it, is the decision of making the movement not locked onto the grid, but instead, are freely hovering over it. I feel like making a grid-based puzzle game that requires precise placements to copy, cut, paste, and or delete, and pair it up with a non-grid-based movement is highly contradictory while also making the usage of the mechanics more frustrating. Moreover, the movement also has a slipperiness to it that makes navigating less precise.`,
